si no tiene cuidado.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:48.840
Azure Monitor

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:49.500
se basa en el uso.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:50.720
Todo paga por la ingesta

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.140
de registros,

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:51.540
retención,

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.420
métricas personalizadas

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:52.880
y alertas.

